      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Welcome to the table, before playing, let''s get a brief knowledge of
    our oponents and choose for yourself an assistand to play with


    - Player
    1 ( Tight ): Tight range, rarely bluffs, only play strong hands

    - Player
    2 ( Loose ) : Wide range, calls more often but don''t play garbage hands, he
    can usually has second pair, careful to bluff this player.

    - Player 3 (
    Passive ): Wide range but likes to call more then bet


    Recommended Strategy:
    We can play aggressive at this table, betting big to get max value from overcallers,
    but we can play safe against player1, check or fold when he bets if we have marginal
    hands. '
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
