  m_text: 'Well well, You hit top pair, top freaking kicker. Player 2 often overcalls
    on the flop. It is time for you to extract more value from this player. This
    poor man knows nothing more than calling with lower Queens and giving his chips
    to us, what a lovely day. Recommended action:

    - 70% bet 66% pot (14BB)

    -
    20% bet 125% pot (26.25BB)

    - 10% check'
