  m_text: 'A Jack of Diamond is a total brick and the opponent has many worse queens
    and some JX hands. You know it is time to do what? There is the holy word you
    have been waiting for! It is all all all in the facking pot! Suggested action:

    -
    60% bet all-in (52.5BB)

    - 30% bet 33% pot (32.5BB)

    - 10% check.'
