      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'You have a strong hand. I see Player 2 bets frequently with a wide range,
    while Player 3 calls too much but plays weak hands. Look him straight in the
    face seriously, hold your chips, bet big, kill his spirit, my boy, crush his
    poor soul, make him cry calling. Best move: 3-bet to 9BB to get value from player
    2 as smaller bet will not get Player 3 to call, bigger bet will make player 2
    to fold.'
